OL,3,GNEWSAExterminate! Student surprises    
OL,4,Acampus with Dalek                      
OL,6,FA student has been raising eyebrows on 
OL,7,Fcampus with his final project - a      
OL,8,Flife-size Dalek that he climbs into.   
OL,10,FBen Dobinson spent more than 300 hours 
OL,11,Fbuilding his model from a design based 
OL,12,Fon the relaunched Doctor Who, which    
OL,13,Ffirst aired in 2005.                   
OL,15,FThe 27-year-old from Benfleet, Essex,  
OL,16,Freceived a first-class degree in       
OL,17,Fmodelmaking at the University for the  
OL,18,FCreative Arts (UCA) in Farnham, Surrey.
