OL,3,GNEWSAExterminate! Student surprises    
OL,4,Acampus with Dalek                      
OL,6,FIn the BBC drama, the creature's       
OL,7,Fweakness was its single eye stalk, but 
OL,8,FDobinson said his creation's main enemy
OL,9,Fwas "uneven ground".                   
